# Project rules: SwarnaSetu
> Source: architecture diagram approved in chat, plus the FastAPI + React Native setup. Update in the same PR as any architecture change.
## Architecture
- Style: monolith. One API serves the mobile client.
- Communication: REST. No async broker in this setup.
- Flow: mobile client → FastAPI (authentication, validation, business logic) → GST, HUID, and Interest modules → PostgreSQL
## Frontend decisions
- Framework: React Native (TypeScript) for iOS and Android. The reference diagram also listed React / Next.js or Flutter; this repo uses React Native.
- Theme: white background (`#FFFFFF`) and blue primary (`#1565C0`). Do not follow the device dark theme.
- State/data: local component state until a data layer is chosen
- Folder structure: `SwarnaSetu-mobileapp/` with `ios/` and `android/` runners. API repo: `SwarnaSetu-backend/`
## Backend decisions
- Framework: FastAPI
- Responsibilities: authentication, validation, business logic
- Modules:
  - GST Module: GSP API
  - HUID Module: BIS authorised integration
  - Interest Module: Python calculations
- Database: PostgreSQL through SQLAlchemy 2 and Alembic. URL: `APP_DATABASE_URL`. Records: users, password reset codes, and later GST history, HUID history, interest calculations
- Auth: public routes `/auth/register`, `/auth/login`, `/auth/refresh`, `/auth/forgot-password`, `/auth/reset-password`, `/auth/google`
- Accounts: email or phone, at least one, plus a password. Google sign-in uses a verified email and can create an account with no password
- Tokens: HMAC access token for 15 minutes and refresh token for 7 days, kept in app memory
- Password reset: one 6-digit OTP sent to every contact on the account, hashed, expires in 10 minutes. Reset also requires the current password
- Google: `google-auth` checks the ID token against `APP_GOOGLE_CLIENT_IDS`. The app uses `@react-native-google-signin/google-signin`. Client IDs stay in configuration
- Error format: `{ code, message, details }`
- Settings: environment variables via pydantic-settings (`APP_NAME`, `ENVIRONMENT`, `LOG_LEVEL`, `APP_DATABASE_URL`, `APP_TOKEN_SECRET`, SMTP, SMS, `APP_GOOGLE_CLIENT_IDS`)
- Current code: health check and account auth. GST, HUID, and Interest are not built yet.
## Domain language
- GST: module that integrates with a GSP API
- HUID: module for a BIS authorised integration
- Interest: calculations implemented in Python
## Do not
- Do not add GST, HUID, or Interest endpoints until that slice has an approved contract
- Do not hard-code secrets, GSP credentials, or BIS credentials, and do not use real customer data
